9
00:00:45,890 --> 00:00:50,660
Android uses permissions to protect
resources, data and operations.

10
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:55,790
And applications can also define and
enforce their own permissions to limit

11
00:00:55,790 --> 00:01:00,060
access to their resources and
things like user information.

12
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:04,360
For example, to restrict who can
