16
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:19,000
And the system resources, for example,
to limit which components can use

17
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,520
the device's camera to take pictures or
record videos.

18
00:01:23,780 --> 00:01:27,790
So, in Androids,
permissions are represented as strings.

19
00:01:27,790 --> 00:01:33,750
And applications include these permission
