134
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:19,530
Activity permissions restrict
which components can

135
00:10:19,530 --> 00:10:22,340
start the associated activity.

136
00:10:22,340 --> 00:10:25,420
These permissions are checked
within the execution of methods,

137
00:10:25,420 --> 00:10:29,280
such as start activity, and
start activity for result.

138
00:10:29,280 --> 00:10:34,290
Which, as you you know, are called one
activity tries to start another one.

139
00:10:34,290 --> 00:10:36,405
And if the required permission is missing,

140
00:10:36,405 --> 00:10:38,960
then Android will throw
a security exception.

