00:10:38,960 --> 00:10:43,970
In fact, that's exactly what happened in
the permissions Boom User example that we

142
00:10:43,970 --> 00:10:45,910
just went over a few seconds ago.

143
00:10:48,110 --> 00:10:51,630
Service permissions restrict
which components can start or

144
00:10:51,630 --> 00:10:55,420
