stop or connect to services.

148
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:09,991
Using methods such as
Context.startService(),

149
00:11:09,991 --> 00:11:14,761
Context.stopService(), or
Context.bindService().

150
00:11:15,865 --> 00:11:17,460
Just as with activities,

151
00:11:17,460 --> 00:11:22,090
Androids will throw a security exception
if required permissions are missing.

152
00:11:24,710 --> 00:11:28,290
Broadcast receiver permission restrict
which components can send and

153
